    <string name="addagent_troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="addagent_trouble_direct">1. On the agent\'s computer, check Tailscale is connected and signed in to the same account as this phone.\n2. Check this phone\'s Tailscale app is on.\n3. Ask the agent to run its health check again: curl -s -m 30 -H @$HOME/.config/bridget/header %1$s/health\n4. A 401 means the key is wrong: paste the prompt again or rotate the key.\n5. A timeout means the network path is blocked: try the userspace option instead.</string>
    <string name="addagent_trouble_userspace">1. On the agent\'s host, check tailscaled is running and signed in to the same account as this phone.\n2. Check this phone\'s Tailscale app is on.\n3. Check ~/bin/bridget exists and is executable, and ~/.config/bridget/env has BRIDGET_HOST, BRIDGET_PORT and BRIDGET_KEY.\n4. Ask the agent to run: ~/bin/bridget GET /v1/health\n5. A 401 means the key is wrong: paste the prompt again or rotate the key.</string>
